Revision history for WWW-ARDB

{{$NEXT}}
  - Cached responses now expire after one day (86400 seconds) instead of
    never; an entry without a usable timestamp counts as expired
  - New cache_max_age option on WWW::ARDB and max_age on WWW::ARDB::Cache to
    choose the maximum age, 0 always fetches a fresh response

0.002     2026-01-11 04:38:16Z
  - Complete inline POD documentation for all modules
  - Using PodWeaver conventions (=attr, =method, =opt)

0.001     2026-01-05 04:56:22Z
  - Initial release
  - Items, Quests, ARC Enemies API endpoints
  - CLI tool (bin/ardb)
  - File-based caching
